msgstr "Калі вы лічыце, што гэта незаконна, укажыце, які закон і чаму."

#. Confirmation modal body shown before dismissing the desktop-notification nagbar. {notificationSettingsPath} is the localized settings path.
#: src/features/app/components/layout/app_layout/nagbars/DesktopNotificationNagbar.tsx
