#: src/features/channel/hooks/useDeleteMyMessagesInChannel.tsx
msgid "We couldn't delete your messages right now. Try again in a moment."
msgstr "Зараз не ўдалося выдаліць вашы паведамленні. Паспрабуйце яшчэ раз праз хвіліну."

#. Line after an Operator Pass payment that we refunded right away because emails to the address on the buyer's account bounce, so we could not send the purchase confirmation. The certificate is the numbered Operator certificate PDF that the price pays for. Settings means the user settings, where the email address is changed. No email follows, so never say we'll email.
#: src/features/premium/components/operator_pass/checkout/CheckoutOutcomeStage.tsx
msgid "We couldn't email the address on your account, so we refunded this payment in full and didn't create a certificate. Update your email in settings and you can buy again."
msgstr "Нам не ўдалося адправіць ліст на адрас вашага ўліковага запісу, таму мы цалкам вярнулі гэты плацеж і не стварылі сертыфікат. Абнавіце электронную пошту ў наладах, і вы зможаце купіць зноў."

#. Body of the error modal shown when there is no refundable purchase on the account.
#: src/features/app/components/dialogs/components/plutonium/RefundsSection.tsx
msgid "We couldn't find a recent purchase to refund on this account."
msgstr "На гэтым уліковым запісе не знойдзена нядаўняй пакупкі, за якую можна вярнуць грошы."

#. Body of the error modal shown when an action needs an active subscription but none exists.
#: src/features/app/components/dialogs/components/plutonium/utils/PremiumActionErrorModal.tsx
msgid "We couldn't find an active subscription on this account. Refresh and try again."
msgstr "На гэтым уліковым запісе не знойдзена актыўнай падпіскі. Абнавіце старонку і паспрабуйце яшчэ раз."

#. Error in the import-template form when the desktop app looked up the template and the third-party platform named by {theOtherPlatform} said it does not exist or has expired.
#: src/features/guild/components/modals/add_guild_modal/shared.ts
msgid "We couldn't find that {theOtherPlatform} template. Check the link and try again."
msgstr "Не ўдалося знайсці гэты шаблон {theOtherPlatform}. Праверце спасылку і паспрабуйце яшчэ раз."

#. Error message in the message forward failed modal.
#: src/features/messaging/components/modals/ForwardModal.tsx
msgid "We couldn't forward the message at this time."
msgstr "Зараз не ўдалося пераслаць паведамленне."

#. Error message after importing a theme library file failed.
#: src/features/theme_settings/components/ShareAndBackUpSection.tsx
msgid "We couldn't import that theme library file."
msgstr "Не ўдалося імпартаваць гэты файл бібліятэкі тэм."

#. Error message in the quick CSS editor window.
#: src/features/theme_settings/components/QuickCssFiles.tsx
msgid "We couldn't read that CSS file."
msgstr "Не ўдалося прачытаць гэты файл CSS."

#. Error message in the theme accept modal.
#: src/features/theme/components/modals/ThemeAcceptModal.tsx
msgid "We couldn't read this theme. It may be corrupted or invalid."
msgstr "Не ўдалося прачытаць гэту тэму. Магчыма, яна пашкоджаная або няправільная."

#. Error shown when deleting the stored age range fails.
#: src/features/user/components/modals/tabs/privacy_safety_tab/AgeRangeSection.tsx
msgid "We couldn't remove your age range. Please try again."
msgstr "Не ўдалося выдаліць ваш узроставы дыяпазон. Паспрабуйце яшчэ раз."

#. Error message after saving a theme failed in Settings > Themes or the quick CSS editor window.
#: src/features/theme_settings/utils/ThemeSettingsErrorModal.ts
msgid "We couldn't save that theme."
msgstr "Не ўдалося захаваць гэту тэму."

#. Body of the confirmation shown before deleting the age range. App Attest is an Apple product name and stays in English.
#: src/features/user/components/modals/tabs/privacy_safety_tab/AgeRangeSection.tsx
msgid "We delete the age range, the time we got it and the App Attest keys for your Apple devices. In the UK and Brazil, you can't see 18+ content until the app sends an age range again. The app may send it again later if your Apple or Google account still shares it with Fluxer."
msgstr "Мы выдаляем узроставы дыяпазон, час, калі мы яго атрымалі, і ключы App Attest для вашых прылад Apple. У Вялікабрытаніі і Бразіліі вы не зможаце бачыць змесціва 18+, пакуль праграма зноў не адправіць узроставы дыяпазон. Праграма можа адправіць яго пазней, калі ваш уліковы запіс Apple або Google па-ранейшаму дзеліцца ім з Fluxer."

#. Modal body for existing-subscription block. Directs the user to the billing portal and addresses the just-paid race case. Keep plain and reassuring.
#: src/features/app/components/dialogs/components/plutonium/hooks/useCheckoutActions.tsx
msgid "We found an existing {premiumProductFullName} subscription for this account. Manage it in the secure billing portal to update payment details or check renewal status. If you just paid, wait a minute and reopen this page."
msgstr "Мы знайшлі ў гэтага ўліковага запісу наяўную падпіску {premiumProductFullName}. Кіруйце ёю на абароненым плацежным партале, каб абнавіць плацежныя звесткі або праверыць стан працягнення. Калі вы толькі што заплацілі, пачакайце хвіліну і адкрыйце гэту старонку зноў."

#. Nagbar body announcing a price cut to people in Brazil who do not have a paid subscription. {premiumProductName} is the short paid product name. {monthlyPrice} and {yearlyPrice} are currency amounts already formatted and localized by code; never write an amount into the translation. Keep the tone calm and plain.
#: src/features/premium/config/PriceAnnouncementCampaign.ts
msgid "We lowered the price of {premiumProductName} in Brazil. It is now {monthlyPrice} a month or {yearlyPrice} a year."
msgstr "Мы знізілі цану {premiumProductName} у Бразіліі. Цяпер гэта {monthlyPrice} у месяц або {yearlyPrice} у год."

#. Text in the Operator Pass checkout dialog while the app waits for the payment. The payment page opened in the web browser, and the dialog changes by itself when the payment is done. This window means the checkout dialog in the app.
#: src/features/premium/components/operator_pass/checkout/CheckoutWaitingStage.tsx
msgid "We opened the payment page in your browser. This window updates once your payment goes through."
msgstr "Мы адкрылі старонку аплаты ў вашым браўзеры. Гэта акно абновіцца, як толькі аплата пройдзе."

#. Notice in the Operator Pass checkout dialog when the pass was removed from the account permanently. Operator Pass is a product name and stays untranslated.
#: src/features/premium/components/operator_pass/checkout/CheckoutNoticeStage.tsx
msgid "We permanently removed what comes with the {operatorPassName} from this account, so it can't buy a pass again."
msgstr "Мы назаўсёды прыбралі з гэтага ўліковага запісу ўсё, што ідзе з {operatorPassName}, таму ён больш не можа купіць пропуск."

#. Hint under the name field for the Operator certificate. The certificate can print names in any writing system, such as Latin, Arabic, Chinese or Devanagari. The buyer can put the name of a friend on the certificate when the pass is a gift.
#: src/features/premium/components/operator_pass/OperatorPassCertificateNamesField.tsx
msgid "We print each name exactly as you type it. Buying for someone else? Put their name on their certificate."
msgstr "Мы друкуем кожнае імя дакладна так, як вы яго ўводзіце. Купляеце для іншага чалавека? Укажыце на яго сертыфікаце яго імя."

#. Hint under the name field for the Operator certificate when a Visionary turns on the Operator Pass that comes with Visionary. The certificate can print names in any writing system, such as Latin, Arabic, Chinese or Devanagari.
#: src/features/premium/components/operator_pass/OperatorPassVisionaryModal.tsx
msgid "We print the name exactly as you type it."
msgstr "Мы друкуем імя дакладна так, як вы яго ўводзіце."

#: src/features/auth/components/modals/BackupCodesModal.tsx
msgid "We recommend saving these codes now so that you don't get locked out of your account."
msgstr "Раім захаваць гэтыя коды зараз, каб не страціць доступ да ўліковага запісу."

#. Sentence in the withdrawal dialog. {amount} is a price with currency. "Withdraw" means using the consumer right of withdrawal on an Operator Pass purchase for a full refund, before the certificate is delivered or, where the law keeps the right after delivery such as in Brazil, within the days it gives. Never a word for taking money out.
#: src/features/premium/components/operator_pass/OperatorPassWithdrawModal.tsx
msgid "We refund {amount} to your original payment method."
msgstr "Мы вернем {amount} на ваш першапачатковы спосаб аплаты."

#. Line after an Operator Pass payment that we refunded right away without delivering it, in a case where no email about it follows. The certificate is the numbered Operator certificate PDF that the price pays for. Never say we'll email.
#: src/features/premium/components/operator_pass/checkout/CheckoutOutcomeStage.tsx
msgid "We refunded this payment in full and didn't create a certificate."
msgstr "Мы цалкам вярнулі гэты плацеж і не стварылі сертыфікат."

#. Line after an Operator Pass payment that we refunded right away, for example because sales to consumers in the buyer's country are paused, the certificate names were missing, or the buyer withdrew before delivery. The certificate is the numbered Operator certificate PDF that the price pays for. The buyer also gets an email that explains why, which can go out some time after this page shows, so keep it in the future tense.
#: src/features/premium/components/operator_pass/checkout/CheckoutOutcomeStage.tsx
msgid "We refunded this payment in full and didn't create a certificate. We'll email you the details."
msgstr "Мы цалкам вярнулі гэты плацеж і не стварылі сертыфікат. Падрабязнасці мы дашлём вам па электроннай пошце."

#. Line after an Operator Pass payment that we refunded in full after the certificate was already delivered, for example after a withdrawal. The buyer also gets an email that explains why, which can go out some time after this page shows, so keep it in the future tense.
#: src/features/premium/components/operator_pass/checkout/CheckoutOutcomeStage.tsx
msgid "We refunded this payment in full. We'll email you the details."
msgstr "Мы цалкам вярнулі гэты плацеж. Падрабязнасці мы дашлём вам па электроннай пошце."

#. Error text for static emoji uploads that still exceed the file size limit after resizing. {fileSize} and {maxSize} are formatted file sizes.
#: src/features/guild/components/modals/guild_tabs/GuildEmojiTab.tsx
msgid "We resized and compressed this emoji to 128x128 pixels, but it is still {fileSize}. The limit is {maxSize}. Try a simpler image, fewer colors, or a smaller source file."
msgstr "Мы змянілі памер гэтага эмоджы да 128x128 пікселяў і сціснулі яго, але яно ўсё роўна займае {fileSize}. Ліміт — {maxSize}. Паспрабуйце прасцейшую выяву, менш колераў або меншы зыходны файл."

#. Body of the sticker upload size error modal when a static image remains too large after resizing. {fileSize} and {maxSize} are formatted file sizes.
#: src/features/expressions/components/modals/AddGuildStickerModal.tsx
msgid "We resized and compressed this sticker to 320x320 pixels, but it is still {fileSize}. The limit is {maxSize}. Try a simpler image, fewer colors, or a smaller source file."
msgstr "Мы змянілі памер гэтага стыкера да 320x320 пікселяў і сціснулі яго, але ён усё роўна займае {fileSize}. Ліміт — {maxSize}. Паспрабуйце прасцейшую выяву, менш колераў або меншы зыходны файл."

#: src/features/moderation/components/report/ReportStepVerification.tsx
msgid "We sent a code to {email}."
msgstr "Мы адправілі код на {email}."

#. Short status line after a fresh email code was sent.
#: src/features/auth/AuthMessageDescriptors.ts
msgid "We sent a new code."
msgstr "Мы адправілі новы код."

#. Description under the switch "Welcome me in #operators" in the Operator Pass settings. #operators is a channel in the Fluxer Labs community, keep it as is. Turning the switch on after the pass is delivered still queues the one welcome. Operator Pass is a product name and stays untranslated. A limited profile means the profile privacy setting is anything other than "Friends and all communities". A welcome already sent is edited so it no longer mentions the person.
#: src/features/user/components/modals/tabs/operator_pass_tab/OperatorPassLabsGreetingSetting.tsx
msgid "We welcome you by name in #operators once, soon after your pass is delivered or you turn this on. While your Operator Pass badge is hidden or your profile is limited, we skip the welcome and take your name out of one we already sent."
msgstr "Мы адзін раз прывітаем вас па імені ў #operators неўзабаве пасля выдачы пропуску або пасля таго, як вы гэта ўключыце. Пакуль ваш бэйдж Operator Pass схаваны або ваш профіль абмежаваны, мы не вітаем вас і прыбіраем ваша імя з ужо адпраўленага прывітання."

#: src/features/auth/flow/BrowserLoginHandoffModal.tsx
msgid "We will prefill {prefillEmail} once browser sign-in opens."
msgstr "Мы загадзя ўпішам {prefillEmail}, калі адкрыецца ўваход праз браўзер."

#: src/features/expressions/components/modals/GiftSendToFriendModal.tsx
msgid "We'd love to give you more than a lifetime of {PREMIUM_PRODUCT_NAME}, but that breaks the space-time continuum. Send the gift to a friend instead?"
msgstr "Мы б з радасцю падарылі вам больш, чым пажыццёвы {PREMIUM_PRODUCT_NAME}, але гэта парушыць прасторава-часавы кантынуум. Можа, лепш адправіць падарунак сябру?"

#. Confirm-step copy in the data-export modal when scope is everything.
#: src/features/user/components/modals/tabs/privacy_safety_tab/data_request_modal/DataRequestModal.tsx
msgid "We'll build a downloadable archive of every message you have ever sent and email you when it's ready. The download link in that email expires after 7 days."
msgstr "Мы створым архіў для спампоўкі з усімі паведамленнямі, якія вы калі-небудзь адпраўлялі, і напішам вам, калі ён будзе гатовы. Спасылка для спампоўкі ў лісце дзейнічае 7 дзён."

#. Confirm-step copy in the data-export modal when scope is everything, when no email can reach the account.
#: src/features/user/components/modals/tabs/privacy_safety_tab/data_request_modal/DataRequestModal.tsx
msgid "We'll build a downloadable archive of every message you have ever sent. You can download it from this page when it's ready. The download expires after 7 days."
msgstr "Мы створым архіў для спампоўкі з усімі паведамленнямі, якія вы калі-небудзь адпраўлялі. Калі ён будзе гатовы, яго можна будзе спампаваць на гэтай старонцы. Спампоўка даступная 7 дзён."

#. Confirm-step copy in the data-export modal when scope is custom.
#: src/features/user/components/modals/tabs/privacy_safety_tab/data_request_modal/DataRequestModal.tsx
msgid "We'll build a downloadable archive that matches the filters below and email you when it's ready. The download link in that email expires after 7 days."
msgstr "Мы створым архіў для спампоўкі паводле фільтраў ніжэй і напішам вам, калі ён будзе гатовы. Спасылка для спампоўкі ў лісце дзейнічае 7 дзён."

#. Confirm-step copy in the data-export modal when scope is custom, when no email can reach the account.
#: src/features/user/components/modals/tabs/privacy_safety_tab/data_request_modal/DataRequestModal.tsx
msgid "We'll build a downloadable archive that matches the filters below. You can download it from this page when it's ready. The download expires after 7 days."
msgstr "Мы створым архіў для спампоўкі паводле фільтраў ніжэй. Калі ён будзе гатовы, яго можна будзе спампаваць на гэтай старонцы. Спампоўка даступная 7 дзён."

#. Success toast shown after a data export job is queued when no email can reach the account.
#: src/features/user/components/modals/tabs/privacy_safety_tab/data_request_modal/DataRequestModal.tsx
msgid "We'll process this as soon as possible. Check back here to download your archive when it's ready."
msgstr "Мы апрацуем гэта як мага хутчэй. Вяртайцеся сюды, каб спампаваць архіў, калі ён будзе гатовы."

#. Success toast shown after a bulk message deletion job is queued.
#: src/features/user/components/modals/tabs/privacy_safety_tab/data_request_modal/DataRequestModal.tsx
msgid "We'll process this as soon as possible. You'll get a DM from us when it's done."
msgstr "Мы апрацуем гэта як мага хутчэй. Калі ўсё будзе гатова, вы атрымаеце ад нас асабістае паведамленне."

#. Success toast shown after a bulk message deletion job is queued, on an instance with direct messages turned off that sends email.
#: src/features/user/components/modals/tabs/privacy_safety_tab/data_request_modal/DataRequestModal.tsx
msgid "We'll process this as soon as possible. You'll get an email from us when it's done."
msgstr "Мы апрацуем гэта як мага хутчэй. Калі ўсё будзе гатова, вы атрымаеце ад нас ліст."

#. Success toast shown after a filtered data export job is queued.
#: src/features/user/components/modals/tabs/privacy_safety_tab/data_request_modal/DataRequestModal.tsx
msgid "We'll process this as soon as possible. You'll get an email when your archive is ready."
msgstr "Мы апрацуем гэта як мага хутчэй. Калі ваш архіў будзе гатовы, вы атрымаеце ліст."

#. Success toast shown after a bulk message deletion job is queued, on an instance with direct messages turned off, when no email can reach the account.
#: src/features/user/components/modals/tabs/privacy_safety_tab/data_request_modal/DataRequestModal.tsx
msgid "We'll process this as soon as possible. Your messages will disappear as the work goes on."
msgstr "Мы апрацуем гэта як мага хутчэй. Вашы паведамленні будуць знікаць па меры працы."

#: src/features/auth/components/pages/EmailRevertPage.tsx
msgid "We'll restore your previous email, sign out old sessions, disable MFA, and secure your account with a new password."
msgstr "Мы вернем ваш папярэдні адрас электроннай пошты, завершым старыя сеансы, выключым MFA і абаронім ваш уліковы запіс новым паролем."

#: src/features/moderation/components/report/ReportStepEmail.tsx
msgid "We'll send a short code to confirm you can receive updates about this report."
msgstr "Мы адправім кароткі код, каб пацвердзіць, што вы можаце атрымліваць абнаўленні па гэтай скарзе."

#: src/features/user/components/modals/PasswordChangeModal.tsx
msgid "We'll send a verification code to your email before you can change your password."
msgstr "Перш чым вы зможаце змяніць пароль, мы адправім код пацвярджэння на вашу электронную пошту."

#: src/features/auth/components/modals/BackupCodesViewModal.tsx
msgid "We'll send a verification code to your email before you can view your backup codes."
msgstr "Перш чым вы зможаце паглядзець рэзервовыя коды, мы адправім код пацвярджэння на вашу электронную пошту."

#. Intro text in the dialog for setting a first password on an account that has none.
#: src/features/user/components/modals/PasswordChangeModal.tsx
msgid "We'll send a verification code to your email before you set a password."
msgstr "Перш чым вы зададзіце пароль, мы адправім код пацвярджэння на вашу электронную пошту."

#. Line in the Operator Pass withdrawal dialogs, right above the name field. This is the statutory line saying in which durable form the receipt for the withdrawal is sent, required by EU consumer law (Directive 2023/2673, article 11a) and in Sweden by distansavtalslagen 2 kap. 10 a §. The buyer confirms it by pressing Confirm withdrawal. {email} is the email address of the account, keep it as is. The receipt is an email that acknowledges we received the withdrawal, never a payment receipt.
#: src/features/premium/components/operator_pass/OperatorPassWithdrawModal.tsx
msgid "We'll send your receipt to {email}."
msgstr "Пацвярджэнне атрымання вашай адмовы мы адправім на {email}."

#. Line in the Operator Pass withdrawal dialogs, right above the name field, shown when the account has no email address. This is the statutory line saying in which durable form the receipt for the withdrawal is sent, required by EU consumer law (Directive 2023/2673, article 11a) and in Sweden by distansavtalslagen 2 kap. 10 a §. The buyer confirms it by pressing Confirm withdrawal. Checkout is the payment page where the buyer paid. The receipt is an email that acknowledges we received the withdrawal, never a payment receipt.
