#. Text after a successful Operator Pass purchase, when the certificate can be downloaded but the email with it hasn't gone out yet. The certificate is the Operator certificate PDF. Settings means the user settings. Don't say the email was sent. Operator Pass is a product name and stays untranslated.
#: src/features/premium/components/operator_pass/checkout/CheckoutDoneStage.tsx
msgid "Your {operatorPassName} is ready, and you can download your certificate here or in your settings."
msgstr "Ваш {operatorPassName} гатовы. Сертыфікат можна спампаваць тут або ў наладах."

#. Text after a successful Operator Pass purchase, when the certificate email went out. The certificate is the Operator certificate PDF with a number and the name chosen at checkout. Settings means the user settings. Operator Pass is a product name and stays untranslated.
#: src/features/premium/components/operator_pass/checkout/CheckoutDoneStage.tsx
msgid "Your {operatorPassName} is ready. We emailed your certificate, and you can download it here or in your settings."
msgstr "Ваш {operatorPassName} гатовы. Мы адправілі сертыфікат па электроннай пошце, а спампаваць яго можна тут або ў наладах."

#. Text after a successful Operator Pass purchase, when the certificate PDF can't be downloaded yet. Settings means the user settings. Don't promise when it is done or say it was emailed. Operator Pass is a product name and stays untranslated.
#: src/features/premium/components/operator_pass/checkout/CheckoutDoneStage.tsx
msgid "Your {operatorPassName} is ready. We're still making your certificate, and it shows up in your settings once it's done."
msgstr "Ваш {operatorPassName} гатовы. Мы яшчэ рыхтуем ваш сертыфікат — ён з’явіцца ў наладах, як толькі будзе гатовы."

#. Modal body for existing-subscription block when the subscription was bought in a mobile app store. {storeName} is the store brand name, App Store or Google Play, and must not be translated. {premiumProductFullName} is the full premium product name.
#: src/features/app/components/dialogs/components/plutonium/hooks/useCheckoutActions.tsx
msgid "Your {premiumProductFullName} subscription is billed through {storeName}. Manage it in your {storeName} account to change your plan or check renewal status."
msgstr "Ваша падпіска {premiumProductFullName} аплачваецца праз {storeName}. Каб змяніць план або праверыць стан працягнення, кіруйце ёю ў сваім уліковым запісе {storeName}."

#. Plutonium page hero subtitle when a subscription has ended. premiumProductName is the paid tier name.
#: src/features/premium/components/plutonium_page/PlutoniumPageMessages.ts
msgid "Your {premiumProductName} perks have ended. Subscribe again to bring them back."
msgstr "Вашы перавагі {premiumProductName} скончыліся. Падпішыцеся зноў, каб іх вярнуць."

#. Nagbar body shown while a premium subscription is in its grace period after a failed renewal. {premiumProductName} is the premium product name and {formattedGraceDate} is already localized. Use the same word for "features" as in "See all {premiumProductName} features".
#: src/features/app/components/layout/app_layout/nagbars/PremiumStatusNagbar.tsx
msgid "Your {premiumProductName} subscription failed to renew. You still have access to all {premiumProductName} features until {formattedGraceDate}. Update your payment method before then to keep your access."
msgstr "Не ўдалося працягнуць вашу падпіску {premiumProductName}. Доступ да ўсіх функцый {premiumProductName} у вас застаецца да {formattedGraceDate}. Каб захаваць доступ, абнавіце спосаб аплаты да гэтай даты."

#. Nagbar body shown when a premium subscription has expired. {premiumProductName} is the premium product name. Use the same word for "features" as in "See all {premiumProductName} features".
#: src/features/app/components/layout/app_layout/nagbars/PremiumStatusNagbar.tsx
msgid "Your {premiumProductName} subscription has expired, and you no longer have access to {premiumProductName} features. Reactivate your subscription to get access again."
msgstr "Тэрмін дзеяння вашай падпіскі {premiumProductName} скончыўся, і доступу да функцый {premiumProductName} больш няма. Аднавіце падпіску, каб вярнуць доступ."

#. OAuth authorize page error shown when the session expired mid-authorization. Keep plain. Preserve {productName}; it is inserted by code.
#: src/features/auth/components/pages/oauth_authorize_page/state/useAuthorizeFlow.ts
msgid "Your {productName} session expired. Sign in again to continue authorizing this application."
msgstr "Тэрмін дзеяння вашага сеанса {productName} скончыўся. Увайдзіце зноў, каб працягнуць аўтарызацыю гэтай праграмы."

#. Plutonium subscription card text shown while a failed App Store or Google Play renewal payment is being retried. {storeName} is the store brand name, App Store or Google Play, and must not be translated. {graceDate} is a date already formatted and localized by code; never write a date into the translation.
#: src/features/app/components/dialogs/components/plutonium/SubscriptionDescription.tsx
msgid "Your {storeName} renewal payment failed but <0/> stay active until <1>{graceDate}</1>. Update your {storeName} payment method before then to keep your subscription."
msgstr "Плацеж за працягненне праз {storeName} не прайшоў, але <0/> застаюцца актыўнымі да <1>{graceDate}</1>. Каб захаваць падпіску, абнавіце спосаб аплаты ў {storeName} да гэтай даты."

#. Review row label for the administrator account.
#: src/features/app/components/setup/SetupWizardSteps.tsx
#: src/features/user/components/settings_utils/SettingsConstants.tsx
msgid "Your account"
msgstr "Ваш уліковы запіс"

#: src/features/connection/components/pages/ConnectionCallbackPage.tsx
msgid "Your account has been linked successfully. You can now close this tab and return to the app."
msgstr "Ваш уліковы запіс паспяхова прывязаны. Цяпер гэту ўкладку можна закрыць і вярнуцца ў праграму."

#. Body of the one-time prompt asking a signed-in user without a recovery kit to create one.
#: src/features/user/components/RecoveryKitReminderGate.tsx
msgid "Your account has no email address. If you forget your password, a recovery kit is the only way back in. It only takes a minute."
msgstr "У вашага ўліковага запісу няма адраса электроннай пошты. Калі вы забудзеце пароль, вярнуць доступ можна будзе толькі з набору для аднаўлення. Гэта зойме ўсяго хвіліну."

#. Toast shown after the account was connected to single sign-on from account settings.
#: src/features/auth/components/pages/SsoCallbackPage.tsx
msgid "Your account is connected to single sign-on."
msgstr "Ваш уліковы запіс падключаны да адзінага ўваходу."

#. Settings alert for an unclaimed account on an instance where people sign in with a username.
#: src/features/user/utils/AccountGatePresentation.tsx
msgid "Your account is not yet claimed. Without a username and password, you won't be able to sign in from other devices and you could lose access to your account. Claim your account now to secure it."
msgstr "Ваш уліковы запіс яшчэ не замацаваны. Без імені карыстальніка і пароля вы не зможаце ўваходзіць з іншых прылад і можаце страціць доступ да ўліковага запісу. Замацуйце яго за сабой зараз, каб абараніць."

#: src/features/channel/components/barriers/BarrierComponents.tsx
msgid "Your account is too new to send messages in this community."
msgstr "Ваш уліковы запіс занадта новы, каб адпраўляць паведамленні ў гэтай суполцы."

#. Notice after creating an account on an instance where admins approve new accounts.
#: src/features/auth/flow/AuthRegisterFormCore.tsx
#: src/features/auth/flow/identifier_first/AuthIdentifierFirstStep.tsx
msgid "Your account request is pending approval. You can sign in after an admin approves it."
msgstr "Ваш запыт на ўліковы запіс чакае ўхвалення. Увайсці можна будзе пасля таго, як адміністратар яго ўхваліць."

#: src/features/auth/components/modals/SudoVerificationModal.tsx
msgid "Your account requires multi-factor authentication, but no supported methods are set up on this device. Sign in on a device with your authenticator app or security key, or contact support."
msgstr "Ваш уліковы запіс патрабуе шматфактарнай аўтэнтыфікацыі, але на гэтай прыладзе не наладжаны ніводны спосаб, які падтрымліваецца. Увайдзіце на прыладзе з праграмай-аўтэнтыфікатарам або ключом бяспекі ці звярніцеся ў службу падтрымкі."

#: src/features/auth/components/modals/SudoVerificationModal.tsx
msgid "Your account requires multi-factor authentication, but no supported methods are set up on this device. Sign in on a device with your authenticator app or security key, or contact the administrators of this instance."
msgstr "Ваш уліковы запіс патрабуе шматфактарнай аўтэнтыфікацыі, але на гэтай прыладзе не наладжаны ніводны спосаб, які падтрымліваецца. Увайдзіце на прыладзе з праграмай-аўтэнтыфікатарам або ключом бяспекі ці звярніцеся да адміністратараў гэтага экзэмпляра."

#. Security settings: confirmation modal body for turning off passkey-based two-factor authentication when passkeys are the only second factor on the account.
#: src/features/user/components/modals/tabs/account_security_tab/SecurityTab.tsx
msgid "Your account will no longer be protected by two-factor authentication when you sign in with your password. You'll also lose elevated permissions in servers that require two-factor authentication."
msgstr "Пры ўваходзе з паролем ваш уліковы запіс больш не будзе абаронены двухфактарнай аўтэнтыфікацыяй. Вы таксама страціце пашыраныя дазволы ў суполках, якія патрабуюць двухфактарнай аўтэнтыфікацыі."

#. Detail line in the native dialog shown when the desktop app cannot open its local data store.
#: src/features/platform/utils/DesktopLocaleBridge.ts
msgid "Your accounts and settings have not been changed or deleted."
msgstr "Вашы ўліковыя запісы і налады не зменены і не выдалены."

#. Modal body shown when the safety system blocks the requested action. Keep plain and calm; offer support path.
#: src/features/auth/components/ContentBlockedHandler.tsx
msgid "Your action could not be completed because it was flagged by our safety systems. If you believe this is a mistake, please contact support."
msgstr "Ваша дзеянне не выканана, бо яго пазначылі нашы сістэмы бяспекі. Калі вы лічыце, што гэта памылка, звярніцеся ў службу падтрымкі."

#. Modal body shown on a self-hosted instance when the safety system blocks the requested action. Keep plain and calm.
#: src/features/auth/components/ContentBlockedHandler.tsx
msgid "Your action could not be completed because it was flagged by our safety systems. If you believe this is a mistake, please contact the administrators of this instance."
msgstr "Ваша дзеянне не выканана, бо яго пазначылі нашы сістэмы бяспекі. Калі вы лічыце, што гэта памылка, звярніцеся да адміністратараў гэтага экзэмпляра."

