msgstr "Ваша заяўка чакае разгляду. Вы па-ранейшаму можаце абнавіць звесткі заяўкі або адклікаць яе."

#. Sentence in the Operator Pass withdrawal dialogs, shown instead of the usual one when the withdrawal ends the last Operator Pass on the account and you have Visionary. The badge is the Operator badge on the profile and the wall listing is the spot on the Operators' wall. #operators is the channel name in Fluxer Labs and Visionary is a plan name, keep both as is. Visionary keeps access to #operators under section 13 of the Operator Pass terms.
#: src/features/premium/components/operator_pass/OperatorPassWithdrawModal.tsx
msgid "Your badge and wall listing go too. You keep #operators through your Visionary."
msgstr "Ваш бэйдж і запіс на сцяне таксама знікнуць. Доступ да #operators застаецца ў вас дзякуючы Visionary."

#. Body of the confirmation before offering your last Operator Pass, shown instead of the usual one when you have Visionary. The badge is the Operator badge and the wall listing is your entry on the Operators' wall. #operators is the channel name in Fluxer Labs and Visionary is a plan name, keep both as is. Visionary keeps access to #operators under section 13 of the Operator Pass terms. {name} is the display name of the person you offer it to.
#: src/features/premium/components/operator_pass/OperatorPassPassItOnModal.tsx
msgid "Your badge and wall listing go when the pass moves to {name}. You keep #operators through your Visionary."
msgstr "Ваш бэйдж і запіс на сцяне знікнуць, калі пропуск пяройдзе да карыстальніка {name}. Доступ да #operators застаецца ў вас дзякуючы Visionary."

#. Sentence in the Operator Pass withdrawal dialogs, shown only when the withdrawal ends the last Operator Pass on the account. The badge is the Operator badge on the profile, the wall listing is the spot on the Operators' wall, and #operators is the channel name in Fluxer Labs, kept as is. Together they stand for everything else that comes with the pass.
#: src/features/premium/components/operator_pass/OperatorPassWithdrawModal.tsx
msgid "Your badge, wall listing and #operators go too."
msgstr "Ваш бэйдж, запіс на сцяне і доступ да #operators таксама знікнуць."

#. Body of the confirmation before offering your last Operator Pass. The badge is the Operator badge, the wall listing is your entry on the Operators' wall, and #operators is the channel name in Fluxer Labs, kept as is. Together they stand for everything else that comes with the pass. {name} is the display name of the person you offer it to.
#: src/features/premium/components/operator_pass/OperatorPassPassItOnModal.tsx
msgid "Your badge, wall listing and #operators go when the pass moves to {name}."
msgstr "Ваш бэйдж, запіс на сцяне і доступ да #operators знікнуць, калі пропуск пяройдзе да карыстальніка {name}."

#. Shown in the "Badges" profile settings section when the list of badges fails to load, next to a "Try again" button.
#: src/features/user/components/modals/tabs/my_profile_tab/ProfileBadgeSettings.tsx
msgid "Your badges couldn't be loaded."
msgstr "Не ўдалося загрузіць вашы бэйджы."

#. Toast on the web app when the browser blocks the quick CSS editor window from opening.
#: src/features/theme_settings/components/QuickCssEditorHost.tsx
msgid "Your browser blocked the editor window. Allow pop-ups for this site and try again."
msgstr "Ваш браўзер заблакіраваў акно рэдактара. Дазвольце выплыўныя вокны для гэтага сайта і паспрабуйце яшчэ раз."

#. Error shown when the browser refuses a passkey because the page address does not match its domain.
#: src/features/auth/utils/PasskeyErrorMessages.ts
msgid "Your browser blocked the passkey because this page address does not match the passkey domain of this instance. Ask the instance owner to check the passkey domain setting."
msgstr "Ваш браўзер заблакіраваў ключ доступу, бо адрас гэтай старонкі не адпавядае дамену ключоў доступу гэтага экзэмпляра. Папрасіце ўладальніка экзэмпляра праверыць наладу дамена ключоў доступу."

#. Error shown when the browser refuses a passkey because the page address does not match the domain the passkey belongs to. {rpId} is a domain name such as example.com.
#: src/features/auth/utils/PasskeyErrorMessages.ts
msgid "Your browser blocked the passkey because this page is not on {rpId}, the passkey domain of this instance. Ask the instance owner to check the passkey domain setting."
msgstr "Ваш браўзер заблакіраваў ключ доступу, бо гэта старонка не на {rpId} — дамене ключоў доступу гэтага экзэмпляра. Папрасіце ўладальніка экзэмпляра праверыць наладу дамена ключоў доступу."

#. Description under the "Share audio" switch in the web stream setup modal. The browser picker owns the final audio choice.
#: src/features/voice/components/modals/screen_share_picker_modal/WebStreamSetupModal.tsx
msgid "Your browser lets you choose whether to include audio when you pick what to share."
msgstr "Калі вы выбіраеце, што паказаць, браўзер дазваляе вырашыць, ці перадаваць гук."

#. Body of the browser-audio-required modal explaining why the user must click before audio can play.
#: src/features/voice/components/modals/AudioPlaybackPermissionModal.tsx
msgid "Your browser requires user interaction before audio can be played. Click the button below to enable voice chat."
msgstr "Ваш браўзер патрабуе, каб вы штосьці націснулі, перш чым можна будзе прайграваць гук. Націсніце кнопку ніжэй, каб уключыць галасавы чат."

#. Line in the dialog where you pick who gets one of your Operator Passes. The certificate is the Operator certificate PDF with the name chosen at checkout, and passing the pass on does not change it.
#: src/features/premium/components/operator_pass/OperatorPassPassItOnModal.tsx
msgid "Your certificate doesn't change."
msgstr "Ваш сертыфікат не мяняецца."

#. Toast after replacing the private link to an Operator certificate page with a new one.
#: src/features/premium/components/operator_pass/OperatorPassPurchasesSection.tsx
msgid "Your certificate page has a new link."
msgstr "У старонкі вашага сертыфіката новая спасылка."

#. First line in the dialog where a Visionary turns on the Operator Pass that comes with Visionary. {date} is a long date such as November 20, 2026. Never translate certificate as diploma, card, license or token.
#: src/features/premium/components/operator_pass/OperatorPassVisionaryModal.tsx
